# Example Apps

## Role

Examples are **consumers**, not forks of library logic. Wire libraries via:

- `VideoCallModule.forRoot` / `ChatModule.forRoot`
- `useVideoSocket`, `ChatWindow`, `VideoCallScreen`, `CallOverlay`

## Backend

- Register a global `ValidationPipe`
- Demonstrate callbacks (`onMessageSent` returning `messageId`, `onGetMessages`, `canConnect`)
- Keep demo storage in-memory unless extending for a tutorial

## Mobile

- Resolve server URL with `EXPO_PUBLIC_RTC_SERVER_URL`, falling back to emulator defaults
- Use Expo Router `app/` screens
- Keep call accept navigation and `onCallAccepted` navigation consistent for caller/receiver

## Style

Example-backend may use its Prettier/ESLint (single quotes). Do not force that style back onto the libraries.
